# Prove Your Courage (Q607): a level 75 character outside the Ketra alliance asks Kadun Zu Ketra
# for the quest and is refused, kills Shadith with no quest and gets no head, relogs (an offer
# that was not taken leaves no row), and is refused again. Kadun's first-talk script
# (KetraOrcSupport) is not listed, so his chat window is the default page, as the reference
# serves it for an NPC with no page of its own (Npc.getHtmlPath). A scenario seeds neither the
# Ketra standing nor an item: the offer to an ally, the head going to every ally of the party
# and the trade for the totem are in q607_flow_test.go. Shadith is a fixture monster: the raid
# kill messages are the raid boss's, not the quest's. Expectations are derived from the
# reference source (Q607_ProveYourCourage.java).
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q607_prove_your_courage.golden
character Scout 75
script quest.Q607_ProveYourCourage
item 7235 7219 7213
page npcdefault.htm
page script/quest/Q607_ProveYourCourage/
npc kadun 31370 Folk 10 0 0
npc shadith 25309 Monster 40 0 0

action kadun
action kadun
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=kadun item=0 page=npcdefault.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass npc_{kadun}_Quest
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=kadun item=0 page=script/quest/Q607_ProveYourCourage/31370-02.htm
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  state Q607_ProveYourCourage CREATED
  rows Q607_ProveYourCourage -

kill shadith
  S SystemMessage id=95 1:0 1:0
  items 7235=0
  state Q607_ProveYourCourage CREATED

relog
  state Q607_ProveYourCourage -
  rows Q607_ProveYourCourage -

action kadun
action kadun
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=kadun item=0 page=npcdefault.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass npc_{kadun}_Quest
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=kadun item=0 page=script/quest/Q607_ProveYourCourage/31370-02.htm
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  state Q607_ProveYourCourage CREATED
